§ `s 7 -- the determining amount`
-- determining amount 5000: income 3000 leaves 2000 of headroom, below the 4214 benefit
#ASSERT `s 7(b) the benefit payable where a determining amount applies` 3000 (JUST 5000) 4214 EQUALS JUST 2000
-- income 1000: headroom 4000, the benefit of 2000 is the smaller
#ASSERT `s 7(b) the benefit payable where a determining amount applies` 1000 (JUST 5000) 2000 EQUALS JUST 2000
-- income 4999: headroom 1
#ASSERT `s 7(b) the benefit payable where a determining amount applies` 4999 (JUST 5000) 4214 EQUALS JUST 1
-- income equal to the determining amount, or above it: nothing is paid
#ASSERT `s 7(b) the benefit payable where a determining amount applies` 5000 (JUST 5000) 4214 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `s 7(b) the benefit payable where a determining amount applies` 6000 (JUST 5000) 4214 EQUALS JUST 0
-- no determining amount set by the Minister
#ASSERT `s 7(b) the benefit payable where a determining amount applies` 3000 NOTHING 4214 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(c) section 7 does not apply to the person` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(c) section 7 does not apply to the person` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(c) section 7 does not apply to the person` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(c) section 7 does not apply to the person` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

